content:
好的，这是一个完整可用的单文件扫雷游戏。包含你要求的全部功能：左键翻开、右键插旗（含长按）、剩余雷数与计时器、点空白自动展开、一键重开。

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>扫雷 Mine Sweeper</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#14171d;--panel:#1e232c;--card:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
    --card-hi:rgba(255,255,255,.10);--line:#2a3140;
    --text:#e8edf4;--muted:#9aa5b6;--gold:#f0c05a;
    --blue:#5aa9ff;--red:#ff5a5f;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  body{
    min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%,#202631 0%,var(--bg) 60%);
    color:var(--text);font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;
  }
  h1{margin-bottom:12px;font-size:clamp(22px,4vw,30px);letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:700}
  .board-wrap{
    display:flex;gap:12px;flex-direction:row;
    align-items:flex-start;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:14px;padding:12px 16px;box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
  }
  .toolbar{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;width:150px}
  .stat{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;
    padding:10px 12px;color:var(--text);min-width:120px;
  }
  .stat b{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:18px;min-width:44px;text-align:center}
  .icon-label{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
  .btn{
    width:100%;padding:10px;border:none;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5aa9ff,#3f7fe0);color:#fff;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;
    box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(63,127,224,.35);transition:transform .12s,box-shadow .12s;
  }
  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
  .btn:active{transform:translateY(0)}
  #grid{display:grid;place-items:center;background:#0d1016;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:8px;user-select:none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
  .cell{
    width:44px;height:44px;margin:2px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;position:relative;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3a4659,#2d3747);border:1px solid #3e4a60;
    transition:background .08s,border-color .08s,transform .08s;
  }
  .cell:hover:not(.opened){background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4a5872,#364258);border-color:#56698a}
  .cell.opened{cursor:default;background:var(--card);border-color:var(--line);}
  .cell.flagged{cursor:default;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#45536a,#333e50);border-color:#6a5c8a;}
  .num{color:var(--blue)}
  .n1{color:#5bd97a}.n2{color:#7ec8ff}.n3{color:#ffb86b}.n4{color:#ff9ab0}.n5{color:#ff8fa0}.n6{color:#ff8f6b}.n7{color:#f06a8f}.n8{color:#f05a8f}.n9{color:#e84f6f}
  .boom{animation:pop .35s ease-out}
  @keyframes pop{0%{transform:scale(.4)}60%{transform:scale(1.3)}100%{transform:scale(1)}}
  .mine-rev{color:#ff5a5f;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(255,90,95,.7))}
  .hint{margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}
  .hint kbd{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>扫 雷</h1>
<div class="board-wrap">
  <div class="toolbar">
    <div class="stat"><span id="flag-count"></span><span class="icon-label">🚩 已插</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span id="bomb-count">⚠️</span><span class="icon-label">💣 余雷</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span id="time">0</span><span class="icon-label">⏱ 秒</span></div>
    <button class="btn" id="new-btn">🔄 重新开始</button>
